info.description:
Newman/Postman integration test collection for the Buildiq Nextcloud app.

Covers:
  - the public per-slug manifest endpoint (200 hello-world + 404 unknown);
  - CRUD round-trip on Application objects via OpenRegister's REST API (POST/GET/PUT/DELETE);
  - the manifest after a publish transition.

Assumes the SeedHelloWorld repair step has run on a fresh install and the buildiq + openregister apps are enabled. Run via the runner pattern documented in tests/integration/README.md.

